[{:adr/authoritative_for ["kotoba-git R0 byte-exact Git object bridge" "kotoba-rad R1+ sovereign repository identity/ref/private-grant layer" "private repo secrecy via object encryption, not selective replication" "R0-R4 maturity roadmap for Radicle-equivalent role"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/ref_authorization "{:rules [\"actor DID must be current delegate at parent journal state\" \"actor capability must cover event kind\" \"event/prev must match current journal head unless explicitly importing a fork\" \"ref.update is fast-forward by default; force update requires policy\" \"ref/new must resolve to a Git commit in kotoba-git projection\" \"all reachable objects must have git oid <-> CID bridge\" \"private repos gossip only encrypted objects or availability proofs to non-recipient peers\"]}", :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-rad", :adr/implementation_next "{:module_choice [\"new crate kotoba-rad\" \"or kotoba-git::rad module\"], :types [\"RepoIdentity\" \"RepoRid\" \"RepoEvent\" \"Delegate\" \"RefPolicy\" \"RecipientGrant\" \"RadRepo\"], :methods [\"RadRepo::apply_event\" \"RadRepo::authorize_ref_update\" \"RadRepo::publish_manifest\" \"RadRepo::import_git_dir\"], :reuse [\"kotoba-git for object materialization\" \"kotoba-dht for source-chain/warrant semantics\" \"kotoba-crypto for recipient grants\"]}", :adr/related ["orgs/kotoba-lang/kotoba/docs/ADR-kotoba-rad-git-sovereign-repo.md" "90-docs/adr/2606271600-kotoba-stack-equivalences.edn" "orgs/kotoba-lang/kotoba/crates/kotoba-git" "orgs/kotoba-lang/kotoba/crates/kotoba-dht" "orgs/kotoba-lang/kotoba/crates/kotoba-crypto"], :adr/status "proposed", :adr/id "adr-2606280300-kotoba-rad-git-sovereign-repo", :adr/maturity "[{:stage :R0, :name \"Git object bridge\", :deliverable [\"byte-exact object codec\" \"Datom projection\" \"pack import\" \"snapshot manifest\"], :status :implemented, :location \"orgs/kotoba-lang/kotoba/crates/kotoba-git\"} {:stage :R1, :name \"Signed repo identity\", :deliverable [\"RepoIdentity\" \"RepoRid\" \"RepoEvent\" \"delegate validation\" \"ref authorization\"], :status :next} {:stage :R2, :name \"Private object store\", :deliverable [\"encrypted Git framed blocks\" \"RecipientGrant\" \"epoch rotation\" \"ciphertext-cid replication\"], :status :planned} {:stage :R3, :name \"P2P accountability\", :deliverable [\"Source Chain publication\" \"Warrant mapping\" \"reputation/replication policy\"], :status :partial-primitives-exist} {:stage :R4, :name \"PQ-ready suite\", :deliverable [\"hybrid KEM\" \"hybrid signatures\" \"algorithm migration tooling\"], :status :future}]", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-06-28", :adr/body "\n# ADR-2606280300: kotoba-rad / kotoba-git を主権 repository layer として成熟させる\n\n**Status**: proposed\n**Date**: 2026-06-28\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\n## Decision\n\n`kotoba-git` は R0 の Git object fidelity layer として固定する。Git framed bytes を CID block に\n保存し、SHA-1 Git oid と CID の橋を Datom 化するのが責務で、repo authority は持たない。\n\n`kotoba-rad` は R1 以降の主権 repository layer として定義する。Radicle protocol 実装ではなく、\nrepo identity、delegate、ref authorization、private grants、Source Chain、Warrant を\nkotoba の CID+Datom+DHT 上で表現する。\n\n## Maturity\n\n| Stage | Name | Deliverable | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| R0 | Git object bridge | byte-exact objects, refs, pack import, snapshot manifest | implemented in `kotoba-git` |\n| R1 | Signed repo identity | RID, identity journal, delegate/ref validation | next |\n| R2 | Private object store | encrypted Git object blocks, recipient grants, epoch rotation | next after R1 |\n| R3 | P2P accountability | source-chain publication, warrants, replication/reputation policy | partial primitives exist |\n| R4 | PQ-ready suite | hybrid KEM/signatures, algorithm agility, migration tooling | future |\n\n## Security\n\nPrivate repo secrecy is not based on peer allow-lists. Allow-lists are availability and routing\npolicy. Confidentiality is object encryption:\n\n- replication key = `ciphertext-cid`\n- verification metadata = `plaintext-cid` + Git oid, authority scoped\n- access = capability datom + recipient set + epoch key\n- revocation = epoch rotation, not deletion of already distributed ciphertext\n- PQ target = hybrid KEM/signature metadata (`X25519+ML-KEM`, `Ed25519+ML-DSA/SLH-DSA`)\n\n## Implementation Target\n\nPrimary design lives in:\n\n`orgs/kotoba-lang/kotoba/docs/ADR-kotoba-rad-git-sovereign-repo.md`\n\nThe first implementation should add either a new `kotoba-rad` crate or a `kotoba-git::rad`\nmodule with:\n\n- `RepoIdentity`\n- `RepoRid`\n- `RepoEvent`\n- `Delegate`\n- `RefPolicy`\n- `RecipientGrant`\n- `RadRepo::apply_event`\n- `RadRepo::authorize_ref_update`\n\nThe implementation must reuse `kotoba-git` for all object materialization and `kotoba-dht`\nfor source-chain/warrant semantics.\n\n## Addendum (2026-07-14): R2 (Private object store) implemented in cljc kotoba-rad\n\nThe R1/R2 roadmap above targeted a Rust `kotoba-rad` crate; the actual\nimplementation is the cljc `kotoba-lang/kotoba-rad` (ADR-2607072200). R2 —\n\"encrypted Git object blocks, recipient grants, epoch rotation\" — landed\nthere (`403d2b05`) as three portable namespaces:\n\n- `kotoba-rad.recipient-grant`: X25519 ephemeral-static sealed box\n  (ECDH → HKDF → AES-256-GCM) wrapping a symmetric **epoch key** to a\n  recipient's X25519 pubkey (distinct from their Ed25519 signing did:key).\n  `rotate` re-grants a fresh epoch key to the *current* recipient set only —\n  **revocation = epoch rotation, not deletion of distributed ciphertext**,\n  exactly this ADR's Security model.\n- `kotoba-rad.private-object`: AES-256-GCM of an object's bytes under the\n  epoch key. **replication key = ciphertext CID**; plaintext CID kept as\n  authority-scoped verification metadata (`open` re-hashes to it). A peer\n  without a grant replicates the ciphertext but never reads it.\n- `kotoba-rad.bytes`: the portable JVM/nbb crypto host seam.\n\nFully cljc (X25519 + AES-256-GCM are synchronous on both JCA and\nnode:crypto), cross-verified JVM⇄nbb (a grant/object sealed on one host\nopens on the other). The `RecipientGrant` datom + capability-datom binding\ninto a live repo's object store, and the R4 PQ hybrid (X25519+ML-KEM over\nthe same grant shape), remain future work. The R0/R1 (identity/journal/\ndelegate/sigref/push-gate) primitives this ADR named already exist per\nADR-2607072200.", :db/id -1, :adr/layering "[{:layer :git-object-fidelity, :crate \"kotoba-git\", :responsibility [\"framed Git object codec\" \"SHA-1 oid <-> CID bridge\" \"pack/loose import\" \"refs projection\"], :trust_boundary \"verifies Git object bytes\"} {:layer :repository-identity, :crate-or-module \"kotoba-rad\", :responsibility [\"RID\" \"identity journal\" \"delegates\" \"visibility\" \"policies\" \"epoch keys\"], :trust_boundary \"signed identity journal\"} {:layer :authority, :crate \"kotoba-auth\", :responsibility [\"DID parsing\" \"CACAO grants\" \"signature verification\"], :trust_boundary \"signer authority\"} {:layer :source-chain, :crate \"kotoba-dht\", :responsibility [\"append-only journal\" \"warrants\" \"neighborhood accountability\"], :trust_boundary \"peer accountability\"} {:layer :object-encryption, :crate \"kotoba-crypto\", :responsibility [\"AEAD\" \"HPKE-like wrapping\" \"future hybrid PQ envelopes\"], :trust_boundary \"confidentiality\"} {:layer :distribution, :crate \"kotoba-net/read-plane\", :responsibility [\"CID-over-HTTP\" \"gossipsub\" \"bitswap-style replication\"], :trust_boundary \"transport untrusted\"}]", :adr/privacy "{:principle \"peer allow-list is availability/routing policy, not secrecy boundary\", :replication_key \"ciphertext-cid = hash(ciphertext)\", :verification_metadata [\"plaintext-cid\" \"git oid\"], :access [\"capability datom\" \"recipient set\" \"epoch key\"], :revocation \"epoch rotation; already distributed ciphertext is not erased\", :current_crypto \"X25519 HPKE-like wrapping available in kotoba-crypto\", :pq_target {:kem [:x25519 :ml-kem-768], :signature [:ed25519 :ml-dsa :slh-dsa], :metadata [:alg :hash :sig :kem :key-id :recipient-set :epoch :created-at]}}", :adr/repo_identity "{:rid \"cid(canonical-cbor(repo.identity))\", :genesis_doc_keys [:kotoba.rad/type :kotoba.rad/version :repo/name :repo/visibility :repo/default-branch :repo/git-hash-suite :repo/block-hash-suite :repo/delegates :repo/created-at], :event_kinds [:identity.update :ref.create :ref.update :ref.delete :object.publish :grant.add :grant.revoke :warrant.issue]}", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2606280300: kotoba-rad / kotoba-git sovereign repository maturity", :adr/source-format "edn"}]